# Maximizing Responses to a Nationwide Faculty Survey

**Authors:** Cohen, Arthur M.

## Abstract
Using on-campus facilitators to distribute and retrieve an 11-page questionnaire administered to a nationwide sample of humanities faculty and nonhumanities department chairmen in two-year colleges resulted in an 84 percent return rate. Pilot procedures, selection of the college and faculty samples, and the use of facilitators are described. (Editor/LBH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ164527

